": null, "creator": "nightkeeper", "creator_uid": 2454, "reviewer": 0, "commit_from": "web", "created_at": "1544287437", "length": 24}, {"id": 4166, "uuid": "157d3021-4d95-4152-98b2-7727bf528787", "hitokoto": "有些路很远，走下去会很累。可是，不走，会后悔。", "type": "f", "from": "晓良", "from_who": null, "creator": "晓良", "creator_uid": 2041, "reviewer": 0, "commit_from": "web", "created_at": "1545383130", "length": 23}, {"id": 4171, "uuid": "1381aa7b-528c-4a92-a9f5-6aa7390dd256", "hitokoto": "每天晚上想睡觉的时候，总是不由自主的想硬撑着不睡，没有在等什么，也不知道自己在熬什么", "type": "f", "from": "晓良", "from_who": null, "creator": "晓良", "creator_uid": 2041, "reviewer": 0, "commit_from": "web", "created_at": "1545382913", "length": 42}, {"id": 4172, "uuid": "0cb796d6-4147-413b-93c7-17e3719b30f1", "hitokoto": "心情已经习惯和候鸟一起迁徙只是有些仓惶而已。", "type": "f", "from": "晓良", "from_who": null, "creator": "晓良", "creator_uid": 2041, "reviewer": 0, "commit_from": "web", "created_at": "1545383002", "length": 22}, {"id": 4173, "uuid": "1bc73652-c577-44d0-9c80-fbdd46911ca1", "hitokoto": "你眼中的星海灿烂 是我不曾见过的世外桃源", "type": "f", "from": "晓良", "from_who": null, "creator": "晓良", "creator_uid": 2041, "reviewer": 0, "commit_from": "web", "created_at": "1545383079", "length": 20}, {"id": 4189, "uuid": "0cc670b0-2442-4c6b-8bf5-a612681463bf", "hitokoto": "无论在多不幸的状况下，只要相信自己是幸福的，就能得到幸福。", "type": "f", "from": "网络", "from_who": null, "creator": "晓良", "creator_uid": 2041, "reviewer": 0, "commit_from": "web", "created_at": "1545382969", "length": 29}, {"id": 4190, "uuid": "6fbf16d7-3fe7-4fec-9457-40af7280bf24", "hitokoto": "只有除了爱情什么都不缺的人，才有底气去等待爱情。", "type": "f", "from": "网络", "from_who": null, "creator": "頑張って！", "creator_uid": 2534, "reviewer": 0, "commit_from": "web", "created_at": "1545479996", "length": 24}, {"id": 4197, "uuid": "b2a13e27-460d-40b1-9605-55542c473a8f", "hitokoto": "节日的意义，就是用美好的方式消耗时间", "type": "f", "from": "日食记", "from_who": null, "creator": "Little_Qiu", "creator_uid": 1032, "reviewer": 0, "commit_from": "web", "created_at": "1545799070", "length": 18}, {"id": 4198, "uuid": "2d5274a8-892e-4824-83a0-bdfa90194667", "hitokoto": "出言有尺，嬉闹有度，做事有余，说话有德。", "type": "f", "from": "网络", "from_who": null, "creator": "RGHSSS", "creator_uid": 2349, "reviewer": 0, "commit_from": "web", "created_at": "1545835005", "length": 20}, {"id": 4213, "uuid": "cdb1facf-448a-4083-842c-c203572cb077", "hitokoto": "我想要山盟，你却带给我海誓。", "type": "f", "from": "山有木兮", "from_who": null, "creator": "a纱雾", "creator_uid": 1349, "reviewer": 0, "commit_from": "web", "created_at": "1546000050", "length": 14}, {"id": 4214, "uuid": "5eb5324d-de94-4077-bb65-b665e7e0cfea", "hitokoto": "我想去天涯，你却带我去海角。", "type": "f", "from": "山有木兮", "from_who": null, "creator": "a纱雾", "creator_uid": 1349, "reviewer": 0, "commit_from": "web", "created_at": "1546000119", "length": 14}, {"id": 4226, "uuid": "36b6e175-8da2-42f6-96cf-1b9c1dc98ef6", "hitokoto": "有生之年遇到你，竟花光我所有的运气。", "type": "f", "from": "林夕", "from_who": null, "creator": "RGHSSS", "creator_uid": 2349, "reviewer": 0, "commit_from": "web", "created_at": "1546606251", "length": 18}, {"id": 4229, "uuid": "0719b9ef-a675-42da-9f1e-a5874d835d98", "hitokoto": "别以为我长的帅就认为我遥不可及高不可攀，其实我是海纳百川啊！", "type": "f", "from": "网络", "from_who": null, "creator": "Doraemon!", "creator_uid": 1438, "reviewer": 0, "commit_from": "web", "created_at": "1547700199", "length": 30}, {"id": 4305, "uuid": "1d85d9ad-3cbe-4f22-954f-593f8007fcdb", "hitokoto": "不要刻意去猜测他人的想法，如果你没有智慧与经验的正确判断，通常都会有错误的。", "type": "f", "from": "网络", "from_who": null, "creator": "Doraemon!", "creator_uid": 1438, "reviewer": 0, "commit_from": "web", "created_at": "1551013411", "length": 38}, {"id": 4327, "uuid": "fa295ea4-84d8-49c6-a162-26a0d3a7c58f", "hitokoto": "无论将来会遇到谁，生活都是先从遇到自己开始的。", "type": "f", "from": "苏晨", "from_who": null, "creator": "苏晨", "creator_uid": 3156, "reviewer": 0, "commit_from": "web", "created_at": "1556673673", "length": 23}, {"id": 4330, "uuid": "7bb7b187-f237-4a38-acc9-e8ccbc31b25d", "hitokoto": "哪有什么人生开挂，不过是坚持很久的厚积薄发。", "type": "f", "from": "网络", "from_who": null, "creator": "althezsh", "creator_uid": 185, "reviewer": 0, "commit_from": "web", "created_at": "1555865815", "length": 22}, {"id": 4349, "uuid": "07d1f187-9553-462c-b2b2-b8c55b8be9c8", "hitokoto": "我听到水流进入我的身体，我听到阳光穿透海面。", "type": "f", "from": "深蓝", "from_who": null, "creator": "lrxianed", "creator_uid": 2868, "reviewer": 0, "commit_from": "web", "created_at": "1552036188", "length": 22}, {"id": 4350, "uuid": "793426e4-0418-4f3c-94ad-b0ed31a1dd97", "hitokoto": "跑得快不一定赢，老跌跟头才是成功。", "type": "f", "from": "8848", "from_who": null, "creator": "Doraemon!", "creator_uid": 1438, "reviewer": 0, "commit_from": "web", "created_at": "1552197980", "length": 17}, {"id": 4355, "uuid": "af07d133-7479-40a5-aa54-92ca70f9f3e4", "hitokoto": "梦终于醒了啊，期盼他日我们再萍水相逢吧。", "type": "f", "from": "网络", "from_who": null, "creator": "tgitc", "creator_uid": 3018, "reviewer": 0, "commit_from": "web", "created_at": "1556974561", "length": 20}, {"id": 4360, "uuid": "a2c477a6-5097-4b25-8d37-fcef4b31620d", "hitokoto": "穿山甲到底说了什么？", "type": "f", "from": "暴走大事件", "from_who": null, "creator": "Loiko", "creator_uid": 3172, "reviewer": 0, "commit_from": "web", "created_at": "1556877898", "length": 10}, {"id": 4365, "uuid": "ee6904cd-f6ef-49b6-9062-4bcb53465da7", "hitokoto": "扣首问路，码梦为生。", "type": "f", "from": "网络", "from_who": null, "creator": "彭小呆", "creator_uid": 3110, "reviewer": 0, "commit_from": "web", "created_at": "1556070435", "length": 10}, {"id": 4374, "uuid": "b6b4bc61-1038-4b26-b3d0-11dfdb0eb7ba", "hitokoto": "定义虽然精确，现实极度模糊。", "type": "f", "from": "网络", "from_who": null, "creator": "綾音", "creator_uid": 1570, "reviewer": 0, "commit_from": "web", "created_at": "1553345651", "length": 14}, {"id": 4375, "uuid": "0d41f76a-6852-47fd-9fd4-63679ae0a8aa", "hitokoto": "人每走一步都会损耗 0.6 秒的生命，难道我们会因此停滞不前吗？", "type": "f", "from": "恺伦", "from_who": null, "creator": "綾音", "creator_uid": 1570, "reviewer": 0, "commit_from": "web", "created_at": "1553509496", "length": 32}, {"id": 4383, "uuid": "81be1057-4897-4528-b2d4-b5475cdceac2", "hitokoto": "难受就是难受…不要让开心变成一种负担…", "type": "f", "from": "网络", "from_who": null, "creator": "Little_Qiu", "creator_uid": 1032, "reviewer": 0, "commit_from": "web", "created_at": "1556948286", "length": 19}, {"id": 4388, "uuid": "7c203a83-9317-4fb2-b29f-1016df9a9c88", "hitokoto": "We always keep minority spirit.", "type": "f", "from": "minori", "from_who": null, "creator": "eaea", "creator_uid": 304, "reviewer": 0, "commit_from": "web", "created_at": "1552367855", "length": 31}, {"id": 4397, "uuid": "45e80d61-5631-4314-94c5-995716e10303", "hitokoto": "为什么要把眼影涂得那么红——可能是原来的样子太亲切了吧。", "type": "f", "from": "匿名", "from_who": null, "creator": "卢黑黑", "creator_uid": 2967, "reviewer": 0, "commit_from": "web", "created_at": "1553949199", "length": 28}, {"id": 4398, "uuid": "556249ce-eb11-48ee-b294-a6805f90ef7a", "hitokoto": "今天地铁上明显少了很多人。", "type": "f", "from": "网易云音乐热评", "from_who": null, "creator": "FairHand", "creator_uid": 2963, "reviewer": 0, "commit_from": "web", "created_at": "1553907171", "length": 13}, {"id": 4409, "uuid": "a64fdb12-5521-47cc-be58-b27acaa429bb", "hitokoto": "真正要分开的两个人，连“分手”二字都是多余的，因为殊途同归。", "type": "f", "from": "螚安Vivienne", "from_who": null, "creator": "FairHand", "creator_uid": 2963, "reviewer": 0, "commit_from": "web", "created_at": "1553906927", "length": 30}, {"id": 4414, "uuid": "1572f9da-aced-4f18-8c74-edfbffdb25db", "hitokoto": "前路还很长，我会越来越好，你也不会差。我们各自珍重。", "type": "f", "from": "互联网", "from_who": null, "creator": "FairHand", "creator_uid": 2963, "reviewer": 0, "commit_from": "web", "created_at": "1553907147", "length": 26}, {"id": 4418, "uuid": "c2d16f1e-612b-4038-9da6-399d9b88d4a0", "hitokoto": "想留的人却总难留，想说的话都到嘴边。", "type": "f", "from": "互联网", "from_who": null, "creator": "小轲", "creator_uid": 2984, "reviewer": 0, "commit_from": "web", "created_at": "1554199288", "length": 18}, {"id": 4426, "uuid": "6b7b0596-8cd6-4921-9ba5-6147c56288a5", "hitokoto": "労働者の命は何よりも大切です。", "type": "f", "from": "Internet", "from_who": null, "creator": "wycero", "creator_uid": 3075, "reviewer": 0, "commit_from": "web", "created_at": "1555823636", "length": 15}, {"id": 4442, "uuid": "1667fc91-c9d4-47cd-83fc-fd08de6512c6", "hitokoto": "世界上只有一种真正的英雄主义，那就是在认清生活的真相后依然热爱生活。", "type": "f", "from": "米开朗基罗传", "from_who": null, "creator": "风待葬", "creator_uid": 3262, "reviewer": 0, "commit_from": "web", "created_at": "1558542876", "length": 34}, {"id": 4445, "uuid": "1266e517-baaf-4371-be5d-7d10078cdcd8", "hitokoto": "有幽默感的人，永远都不会默默无闻。", "type": "f", "from": "网络", "from_who": null, "creator": "告死ANGEL", "creator_uid": 3290, "reviewer": 0, "commit_from": "web", "created_at": "1559016904", "length": 17}, {"id": 4450, "uuid": "865e6816-8969-40e4-a0c6-14993578fc87", "hitokoto": "愿你以渺小启程，以伟大结束。", "type": "f", "from": "互联网", "from_who": null, "creator": "百事雪碧", "creator_uid": 3346, "reviewer": 0, "commit_from": "web", "created_at": "1560074747", "length": 14}, {"id": 4455, "uuid": "6aedd8a5-b749-43f1-a2c5-97e18a906aff", "hitokoto": "人生真是讽刺，一个人竟然可以变成自己曾经最讨厌的样子。", "type": "f", "from": "流浪记", "from_who": null, "creator": "QIQI", "creator_uid": 494, "reviewer": 0, "commit_from": "web", "created_at": "1565244626", "length": 27}, {"id": 4457, "uuid": "7500f910-006e-4df4-afdb-1915fe9c4245", "hitokoto": "我寻了半生的春天，你一笑便是了。", "type": "f", "from": "网络", "from_who": null, "creator": "Yly", "creator_uid": 3624, "reviewer": 0, "commit_from": "web", "created_at": "1565336650", "length": 16}, {"id": 4478, "uuid": "4e867af8-07f0-4a7b-b917-2724217c1cb6", "hitokoto": "我只愿你们活着，为你们接风洗尘，带你们俯瞰星空，与你们共舞红尘。 我只愿你们活着。", "type": "f", "from": "网易云评论", "from_who": null, "creator": "17shou_VIP", "creator_uid": 2705, "reviewer": 0, "commit_from": "web", "created_at": "1560070571", "length": 41}, {"id": 4479, "uuid": "ca1bcc08-dcf7-4480-897c-db0dc8bdee8a", "hitokoto": "我怕音乐，它总是让我想起一些不该想的事。他总是会让旧伤复发。", "type": "f", "from": "古龙", "from_who": null, "creator": "17shou_VIP", "creator_uid": 2705, "reviewer": 0, "commit_from": "web", "created_at": "1560070659", "length": 30}, {"id": 4481, "uuid": "28ec0a85-c647-459e-9f16-7c4778c44e74", "hitokoto": "我好累啊，我终于变成了自己当初最讨厌的样子。", "type": "f", "from": "华子我想你", "from_who": null, "creator": "17shou_VIP", "creator_uid": 2705, "reviewer": 0, "commit_from": "web", "created_at": "1560070903", "length": 22}, {"id": 4493, "uuid": "4ec80364-4b3a-4d81-8f68-376b3161e1fb", "hitokoto": "一天很短，开心了就笑，不开心了就过会儿再笑。", "type": "f", "from": "读者", "from_who": null, "creator": "水蜜桃", "creator_uid": 3385, "reviewer": 0, "commit_from": "web", "created_at": "1560912844", "length": 22}, {"id": 4504, "uuid": "63633cf9-ca5c-4dc9-ad5e-6cfc35e23f93", "hitokoto": "你看这个碗他又大又圆~", "type": "f", "from": "Kris Wu", "from_who": null, "creator": "陈俊豪", "creator_uid": 3452, "reviewer": 0, "commit_from": "web", "created_at": "1562111561", "length": 11}, {"id": 4505, "uuid": "b02bca83-823c-4eb2-a7ea-82bceae0f302", "hitokoto": "你看这个面他又长又宽~", "type": "f", "from": "Kris Wu", "from_who": null, "creator": "陈俊豪", "creator_uid": 3452, "reviewer": 0, "commit_from": "web", "created_at": "1562111578", "length": 11}, {"id": 4514, "uuid": "dc8c124e-36db-49d4-a0ae-0b4d420eda94", "hitokoto": "The opoosite of depression is not happiness, but vitality.", "type": "f", "from": "Depression, the secret we share", "from_who": null, "creator": "Little_Qiu", "creator_uid": 1032, "reviewer": 0, "commit_from": "web", "created_at": "1562755928", "length": 58}, {"id": 4515, "uuid": "ad7bd9d2-3445-4938-b52e-3872770aa376", "hitokoto": "Depression is the flaw in love.", "type": "f", "from": "Depression, the secret we share", "from_who": null, "creator": "Little_Qiu", "creator_uid": 1032, "reviewer": 0, "commit_from": "web", "created_at": "1562758388", "length": 31}, {"id": 4535, "uuid": "306bb97b-14ec-4083-844e-0a977774dc13", "hitokoto": "前半生无你，余生请指教。", "type": "f", "from": "网络", "from_who": null, "creator": "Venus", "creator_uid": 3500, "reviewer": 0, "commit_from": "web", "created_at": "1563006527", "length": 12}, {"id": 4536, "uuid": "ae10a4aa-78d4-4ae1-b563-c1e97f425703", "hitokoto": "如果不被畏惧，神又何以为神。", "type": "f", "from": "网易云音乐", "from_who": null, "creator": "Venus", "creator_uid": 3500, "reviewer": 0, "commit_from": "web", "created_at": "1563015011", "length": 14}, {"id": 4538, "uuid": "3ea228bb-fea2-40bd-86a3-b13299a141eb", "hitokoto": "这个世界上没有忽然崩溃的感情，只有压弯骆驼的最后一根稻草。", "type": "f", "from": "知乎匿名用户", "from_who": null, "creator": "QIQI", "creator_uid": 494, "reviewer": 0, "commit_from": "web", "created_at": "1563240200", "length": 29}, {"id": 4541, "uuid": "d8df4bd8-8735-48d5-9b3d-f2f0b393ed70", "hitokoto": "爱永远不是在乎，而是正确的表达。", "type": "f", "from": "知乎用户肥叔", "from_who": null, "creator": "QIQI", "creator_uid": 494, "reviewer": 0, "commit_from": "web", "created_at": "1563273303", "length": 16}, {"id": 4552, "uuid": "9a0f31b1-6b7d-474e-b32b-f5b3128552cc", "hitokoto": "大多数人高估了他们一天能做的事，但低估了他们一年能做的事。", "type": "f", "from": "阮一峰的博客", "from_who": null, "creator": "RtyXmd", "creator_uid": 3544, "reviewer": 0, "commit_from": "web", "created_at": "1563862604", "length": 29}, {"id": 4555, "uuid": "55bea6d0-25a8-45a5-8f6e-151b5d66c353", "hitokoto": "数学期望小到渺茫又如何呢，哪怕结果不如人愿，也要在尘埃落定前奋起一搏。", "type": "f", "from": "Prayer_Descend", "from_who": null, "creator": "tgitc", "creator_uid": 3018, "reviewer": 0, "commit_from": "web", "created_at": "1564050884", "length": 35}, {"id": 4562, "uuid": "b05a8bd3-5947-4a04-b36e-f87b679cded4", "hitokoto": "牵着你手的时候，世界属于我。", "type": "f", "from": "啦啦啦种太阳", "from_who": null, "creator": "详情页评论模拟", "creator_uid": 3561, "reviewer": 0, "commit_from": "web", "created_at": "1564193026", "length": 14}, {"id": 4568, "uuid": "0dc730f5-8232-4b00-80e0-c8d5add4c129", "hitokoto": "“如果不曾开始，永远不会抵达。别忘了答应自己的事，别忘记想去的地方。”", "type": "f", "from": "一禅小和尚", "from_who": null, "creator": "牙人圭uu", "creator_uid": 3596, "reviewer": 0, "commit_from": "web", "created_at": "1564921776", "length": 35}, {"id": 4570, "uuid": "8cff0c07-5b56-495d-b7e0-168abeb91a14", "hitokoto": "如果必须要失去，那么不如一开始就不曾拥有。", "type": "f", "from": "知乎用户尚守晨", "from_who": null, "creator": "QIQI", "creator_uid": 494, "reviewer": 0, "commit_from": "web", "created_at": "1565146744", "length": 21}, {"id": 4573, "uuid": "bc97dff4-0a40-4448-8500-5b9e7d93797f", "hitokoto": "Dreams don't come for free. 梦想不会平白无故实现。", "type": "f", "from": "小七", "from_who": null, "creator": "北末", "creator_uid": 2040, "reviewer": 0, "commit_from": "web", "created_at": "1565525733", "length": 39}, {"id": 4574, "uuid": "3b995cde-d65d-456e-b67a-1a483a4c6766", "hitokoto": "书上说，如果有一天你梦见了一个很久没见的人，代表他/她正在遗忘你。", "type": "f", "from": "贫小子", "from_who": null, "creator": "贫小子", "creator_uid": 3646, "reviewer": 0, "commit_from": "web", "created_at": "1565616255", "length": 33}, {"id": 4590, "uuid": "a010d186-bb81-491d-a2a6-d4679c533e80", "hitokoto": "夏天重要的事不过一二：能够静静吹风，可以好好吃饭。", "type": "f", "from": "日食记", "from_who": null, "creator": "Little_Qiu", "creator_uid": 1032, "reviewer": 0, "commit_from": "web", "created_at": "1566659381", "length": 25}, {"id": 4622, "uuid": "be5845b8-b91d-476d-b0eb-4907dba5e417", "hitokoto": "花开如火，也如寂寞。", "type": "f", "from": "——顾城", "from_who": null, "creator": "sahara", "creator_uid": 1423, "reviewer": 0, "commit_from": "web", "created_at": "1567795200", "length": 10}, {"id": 4624, "uuid": "7ff49c15-a58c-4ad9-9b13-36af038d0779", "hitokoto": "比起担心会后悔而什么都不做，还不如做完了再去后悔。", "type": "f", "from": "网络；忘记在哪看到的了", "from_who": null, "creator": "史诗级的肉卷丝", "creator_uid": 3866, "reviewer": 0, "commit_from": "web", "created_at": "1567880697", "length": 25}, {"id": 4625, "uuid": "f4ce9b7b-cc74-450f-b36e-d1875ef87cce", "hitokoto": "永远不要放弃你真正想要得到的东西，等待虽难，但后悔更甚。", "type": "f", "from": "网络", "from_who": null, "creator": "苏宁", "creator_uid": 3872, "reviewer": 0, "commit_from": "web", "created_at": "1567942656", "length": 28}, {"id": 4633, "uuid": "ceedd4bc-7dc3-4c1f-8fd2-dc54ff5c7983", "hitokoto": "自立自主总胜过俯首为奴！", "type": "f", "from": "网络", "from_who": null, "creator": "网友CC、", "creator_uid": 3881, "reviewer": 0, "commit_from": "web", "created_at": "1568016340", "length": 12}, {"id": 4638, "uuid": "15d10d5b-f7f2-481f-b177-7003898aca76", "hitokoto": "所爱隔山海 山海亦可平", "type": "f", "from": "来自网络", "from_who": null, "creator": "晴和君", "creator_uid": 3923, "reviewer": 0, "commit_from": "web", "created_at": "1568870947", "length": 11}, {"id": 4639, "uuid": "051aeb2c-5f66-4bc0-9271-1358cd027d63", "hitokoto": "岁月永远年轻，我们慢慢老去，你会发现，童心未泯是一件值得骄傲的事情。", "type": "f", "from": "宫崎骏", "from_who": null, "creator": "Little_Qiu", "creator_uid": 1032, "reviewer": 0, "commit_from": "web", "created_at": "1568951629", "length": 34}, {"id": 4640, "uuid": "8ded38d9-72e0-4c1e-83fb-89747d3adbe6", "hitokoto": "数星星的孩子，是在和夜晚的星空交谈，而不是为了得到一个数字。", "type": "f", "from": "来自网络", "from_who": null, "creator": "Little_Qiu", "creator_uid": 1032, "reviewer": 0, "commit_from": "web", "created_at": "1568951730", "length": 30}, {"id": 4641, "uuid": "8b996ae2-0289-4717-bd38-acfb62d8d063", "hitokoto": "人类最高级别的安慰，就是理解别人的痛苦，并陪伴他。", "type": "f", "from": "来自网络", "from_who": null, "creator": "Little_Qiu", "creator_uid": 1032, "reviewer": 0, "commit_from": "web", "created_at": "1568951681", "length": 25}, {"id": 4644, "uuid": "d5ba5a37-c078-4f9f-8605-a4da38acc2e2", "hitokoto": "小时候词不达意，长大了言不由衷。", "type": "f", "from": "网络", "from_who": null, "creator": "伟.", "creator_uid": 3962, "reviewer": 1044, "commit_from": "web", "created_at": "1569220489", "length": 16}, {"id": 4645, "uuid": "78195693-73aa-43df-a55b-fee39c1be077", "hitokoto": "小时候怕鬼，因为他们面目狰狞；长大后怕人，因为他们衣冠楚楚。", "type": "f", "from": "网络", "from_who": null, "creator": "伟.", "creator_uid": 3962, "reviewer": 1044, "commit_from": "web", "created_at": "1569220530", "length": 30}, {"id": 4681, "uuid": "2623a0a9-6ba7-44d3-9332-56c23469cc4b", "hitokoto": "如果你希望自由，请以你的国家为荣。如果你希望民主，请维护自己的主权。如果你希望和平，请热爱你的国家。", "type": "f", "from": "唐纳德·特朗普", "from_who": null, "creator": "admin", "creator_uid": 2260, "reviewer": 1044, "commit_from": "web", "created_at": "1570069681", "length": 50}, {"id": 4683, "uuid": "c7adcd60-71c0-4edd-a852-e13d0902a5cd", "hitokoto": "我们各自努力，最高处见。", "type": "f", "from": "知乎", "from_who": null, "creator": "憨憨", "creator_uid": 4021, "reviewer": 1044, "commit_from": "web", "created_at": "1570243761", "length": 12}, {"id": 4783, "uuid": "b8b3e14b-1a81-402a-864a-d137eb0f60e7", "hitokoto": "雪崩时，没有一片雪花是无辜的！", "type": "f", "from": "网络", "from_who": null, "creator": "M&Yu", "creator_uid": 4055, "reviewer": 4756, "commit_from": "web", "created_at": "1571143787", "length": 15}, {"id": 4788, "uuid": "26598529-bdcd-46a5-85f2-abc25b011898", "hitokoto": "你只需看着别人精彩，老天对你另有安排", "type": "f", "from": "春天", "from_who": null, "creator": "春天", "creator_uid": 4104, "reviewer": 4756, "commit_from": "web", "created_at": "1571538132", "length": 18}, {"id": 4797, "uuid": "b83cde67-67c8-4691-85ea-94a202bc2963", "hitokoto": "音无结弦之日，悦动天使之心，立于浮华之世，奏响天籁之音。", "type": "f", "from": "网络", "from_who": null, "creator": "魑星辰", "creator_uid": 4074, "reviewer": 4756, "commit_from": "web", "created_at": "1572012010", "length": 28}]